From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lusoris <lusoris@pm.me>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 20:13:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] avfilter: add the vmafx and vmafx_tune filters on the VMAFx
 API

One filter for every VMAFx backend: the backend follows the input frames
(software frames on the CPU, CUDA frames imported without a copy), the
options come from the library's option groups (vf_vmafx_options.h,
generated) with the libvmaf filter's names as aliases, n_stats windows
run on the library's window clock, and the provenance record goes to the
log and the report. vmafx_tune, the libvmaf_tune filter's capability on
the same scoring path, recommends a CRF for the next pass. Built with
--enable-libvmafx.
---
